{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Reserve child completion before offloading its result.** The parent can reach early map/parallel completion after the first check but while serialization/offloading runs. The second check then suppresses the checkpoint, leaving an unreferenced external payload and executing side effects for a skipped child. Atomically reserve completion eligibility with the parent before offloading, and add an early-completion race test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7odV5-","finding_digest":"f80a77f2286ba9c66b27fe9c2ea342f8f1460dc8eedace21a55ccf090ba34e4f","finding_id":"arf_v1_7afhp4rinou4m2zh72oc5i2c7d","finding_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::handlechildcontextsuccess::late-child-offload-side-effect","identity_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::handlechildcontextsuccess::late-child-offload-side-effect","line":159,"observation_digest":"f4dba30139f07b65d5f47a115fdf5e0378fbc9166d1731f384e80e9149f6f8ea","observation_id":"aro_v1_6tn2gajz6b5wlvpupiiv7x26an","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/ChildContextOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_7afhp4rinou4m2zh72oc5i2c7d","published_at":"2026-09-01T01:42:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_y4uqxr6ent2ugk5s45mv6riko3","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"a0efe059d6ac7ac4f5774a29ff6ccc850c986dab","reviewer":"codex","start_line":158,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_geqqyoshry5qx25rs6xcituy3y","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T01:42:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
